Generic single-database configuration with an async-compatible psycopg3 engine.

Run from backend/:
    uv run alembic upgrade head          # apply all pending migrations
    uv run alembic downgrade -1          # roll back one revision
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"  # draft new migration
    uv run alembic history               # show applied revisions
    uv run alembic current               # show current DB revision

Every autogenerated migration MUST be reviewed before applying.
Supabase-specific ops (extensions, HNSW/GIN indexes, RLS) are never
autogenerated and must be written by hand in the migration file.
